@post_election
on-arrival: {!
// set congress proportion to votes
Q.marcher_r = Q.marcher_votes;
Q.unionist_r = Q.unionist_votes;
Q.collectivist_r = Q.collectivist_votes;
Q.ddp_r = Q.ddp_votes;
Q.gold_r = Q.gold_votes;
Q.traditionalist_r = Q.traditionalist_votes;
Q.royalist_r = Q.royalist_votes;
Q.other_r = Q.other_votes;

// The largest party can only be the Royalists or the <span style="color: #c00000;">**Marchers**</span>.
Q.largest_party = 'Marcher';
if (Q.royalist_r >= Q.marcher_r && Q.royalist_r >= Q.collectivist_r) {
    Q.largest_party = 'Royalist';
}
if (Q.collectivist_r >= Q.marcher_r && Q.collectivist_r >= Q.royalist_r) {
    Q.largest_party = 'Collectivist';
}

// coalitions
Q.weimar_coalition = Q.marcher_r + Q.ddp_r + Q.unionist_r - 3;
Q.grand_coalition = Q.marcher_r + Q.ddp_r + Q.unionist_r + Q.gold_r;
Q.bourgeois_coalition = Q.ddp_r + Q.unionist_r + Q.gold_r + Q.other_r;
Q.center_right_coalition = Q.unionist_r + Q.ddp_r + Q.gold_r + Q.other_r + Q.traditionalist_r;
Q.right_coalition = Q.unionist_r + Q.gold_r + Q.other_r + Q.traditionalist_r;
Q.far_right_coalition = Q.traditionalist_r + Q.royalist_r;
Q.left_coalition = Q.marcher_r + Q.collectivist_r;
// this is an absurd concept lol
Q.united_front_coalition = Q.marcher_r + Q.collectivist_r + Q.unionist_r + Q.ddp_r - 3;
Q.anti_democratic_coalition = Q.collectivist_r + Q.royalist_r;
// aka everyone except nazi, kpd, dnvp
Q.neo_weimar_coalition = Q.marcher_r + Q.ddp_r + Q.unionist_r + Q.gold_r + Q.other_r;
!}

The electoral system is essentially proportional, with the proportion of Assembly seats roughly equal to the proportion of votes.
 
**Election results:**

# 1928: 30, 1930: 25, 1932: 22
Marchers: [+ marcher_r +]

# 1928: 15, 1930: 15, 1932: 
Z + Arcanists: [+ unionist_r +]

# 1928: 10, 1930: 13
Collectivists: [+ collectivist_r +]

# 1928: 5, 1930: 4 (as CSP)
Golds: [+ ddp_r +]

# 1928: 9, 1930: 5
Golds: [+ gold_r +]

# 1928: 14, 1930: 7
Traditionalists: [+ traditionalist_r +]

# 1928: 3, 1930: 18
Royalists: [+ royalist_r +]

# 1928: 9, 1930: 10
Other: [+ other_r +]

**Potential coalitions:**

Unity Coalition (Marchers + Z + Golds): [+ weimar_coalition +]

Unity Coalition (Marchers + Z + Arcanists + Golds + Golds): [+ grand_coalition +]

Propertied Coalition (Z + Arcanists + Golds + Golds + Others): [+ bourgeois_coalition +]

Right-wing Coalition (Z + Arcanists + Golds + Others + Traditionalists): [+ right_coalition +]

